# mole's manifest — read at runtime by lib/version.nu. mole core declares exactly
# ONE version: the api version, i.e. the core<->submodule contract version
# (native semver, no `v` prefix). Every submodule declares an api requirement
# (a semver-range) against THIS number. Bump it here, not in code.
{
  api: "0.1.0"
}
